Description Two institutions may number their transactions alike. The test is
Description scoped to the account the statement is for.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type       | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking        | Bank       | false       |
| Liabilities:Visa       | CreditCard | false       |
