| AccountPath | Liabilities:Visa |
When transactions imported : OfxTransactions
| TrnType | DatePosted | Amount | FitId | Name       | Memo | CheckNum |
| DEBIT   | 2024-01-15 | -45.00 | 00001 | SOME SHOP  | none | none     |
Then import summary is : ImportSummary Vertical
| New       | 1 |
| Duplicate | 0 |
| Matched   | 0 |
| Possible  | 0 |

