Description A posting row that also carries the identifier it was imported with.
| Attribute | Type           | Default    |
| Ref       | TransactionRef |            |
| Date      | Date           | 2024-01-01 |
| Payee     | PayeeName      | none       |
| Account   | AccountPath    |            |
| Amount    | Money          | 0.00       |
| Cleared   | ClearedStatus  | Uncleared  |
| FitId     | FitId          | none       |

