| Assets:Checking        | Bank    | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense | false       |
Given import target is : ImportTarget Vertical
| AccountPath | Assets:Checking |
When transactions imported : OfxTransactions
| TrnType | DatePosted | Amount | FitId       | Name               | Memo     | CheckNum |
